OL,3,AMan killed by falling tree as Storm
OL,4,ABoelo leaves 160,000 properties without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 60-year-old man has died after being
OL,8,Fhit by a falling tree in southern
OL,9,FScotland as Storm Boelo continues to
OL,10,Fbring severe weather to the UK.
OL,12,FPolice Scotland said the man was
OL,13,Fpronounced dead at the scene following
OL,14,Fthe incident near Castle Douglas in
OL,15,FDumfries and Galloway at about 10:30 on
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,18,FThe harsh weather battering the UK had
OL,19,Fleft 161,400 properties without power
OL,20,Fas of 15:00 GMT on Sunday afternoon,
OL,21,Fthe Energy Networks Association (ENA)
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
