OL,3,AMan killed by falling tree as Storm
OL,4,ABoelo leaves 160,000 properties without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FThose still without electricity have
OL,8,Ffaced delays as the dangerous
OL,9,Fconditions were "limiting network
OL,10,Fengineers' opportunities to safely
OL,11,Fstart the work", the ENA added.
